# Allowlist: only the web app goes into the build context. Local build output
# and dependencies are rebuilt inside the image, and web/.env* stays out so
# production values (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE) are never baked into this build.
*
!web
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/.vercel
web/.env*
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
